Package: playlistforge
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pyside6.qtcore (>= 6.7), python3-pyside6.qtgui (>= 6.7), python3-pyside6.qtwidgets (>= 6.7), yt-dlp (>= 2024.8.6), python3-openpyxl (>= 3.1)
Recommends: deno (>= 1.0)
Maintainer: PlaylistForge Contributors
Description: Extract, clean, transform, and export YouTube playlists
 PlaylistForge is a modern desktop utility that extracts YouTube
 playlist information and exports it into multiple structured formats.
 .
 Features:
  * Extract playlist metadata from one or many YouTube URLs
  * Preview every video in a sortable, searchable table
  * Clean titles with configurable rules and regex
  * Export to JSON, CSV, TXT, Markdown, HTML, Excel, and clipboard
  * Dark mode and light mode themes
  * History and favorites for quick access
 .
 This package installs PlaylistForge as a system application with
 desktop integration.
